{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01075","headline":"相和歌辞 采桑 · 李彦暐","name":"相和歌辞 采桑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"采桑畏日高，不待春眠足。\n攀条有余愁，那矜貌如玉。\n千金岂不赠，五马空踟躅。\n何以变真性，幽篁雪中绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李彦暐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01075.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01075","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}